<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="color-picker" data-kv-variant="palette-table" data-klic-component="color-picker" class="kn-color-picker"><header data-part="heading"><strong>브랜드 팔레트</strong></header><div tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="데이터 표" data-part="table-scroll"><table ><thead><tr><th scope="col">역할</th><th scope="col">색상</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>주요 행동</td><td><label data-part="field"><span>주요 행동 색상</span><input type="color" value="#245fc2"  data-part="input"></label></td></tr><tr><td>텍스트</td><td><label data-part="field"><span>텍스트 색상</span><input type="color" value="#172b49"  data-part="input"></label></td></tr><tr><td>보조</td><td><label data-part="field"><span>보조 색상</span><input type="color" value="#536fa3"  data-part="input"></label></td></tr></tbody></table></div><output data-kv-color-output aria-live="polite" data-part="output">색상을 선택해 값을 확인하세요.</output></div>
